sage\n  - `summary-origin-autocomplete-suggestion-{IATA_CODE}` - Individual suggestions (e.g., `summary-origin-autocomplete-suggestion-SFO`)\n\n- **Destination prefix:** `summary-dest-autocomplete`\n  - `summary-dest-autocomplete-container` - Container\n  - `summary-dest-autocomplete-input` - Input field\n  - `summary-dest-autocomplete-dropdown` - Dropdown container\n  - `summary-dest-autocomplete-no-results` - No results message\n  - `summary-dest-autocomplete-suggestion-{IATA_CODE}` - Individual suggestions (e.g., `summary-dest-autocomplete-suggestion-ORD`)\n\n### 4. DatePicker Component Test IDs\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/DatePicker.tsx`\n\nThe component uses a `testIdPrefix` prop to generate dynamic test IDs. For SearchSummaryBar usage:\n- **Departure date prefix:** `summary-departure`\n  - `summary-departure-container` - Container\n  - `summary-departure-trigger` - Trigger button\n  - `summary-departure-calendar` - Calendar container\n  - `summary-departure-prev-month` - Previous month navigation\n  - `summary-departure-month-label` - Month/year display\n  - `summary-departure-next-month` - Next month navigation\n  - `summary-departure-day-{YYYY-MM-DD}` - Individual day buttons (e.g., `summary-departure-day-2026-04-25`)\n  - `summary-departure-error` - Error message\n  \n- **Return date prefix:** `summary-return`\n  - `summary-return-container` - Container\n  - `summary-return-trigger` - Trigger button\n  - `summary-return-calendar` - Calendar container\n  - `summary-return-prev-month` - Previous month navigation\n  - `summary-return-month-label` - Month/year display\n  - `summary-return-next-month` - Next month navigation\n  - `summary-return-day-{YYYY-MM-DD}` - Individual day buttons (e.g., `summary-return-day-2026-04-28`)\n  - `summary-return-error` - Error message\n\n### 5. PassengerCountSelector Component Test IDs\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/PassengerCountSelector.tsx`\n\n- `passenger-count-selector` - Main container\n- `passenger-count-trigger` - Trigger button\n- `passenger-count-dropdown` - Dropdown container\n- `passenger-row-adults` - Adults row\n  - `adults-decrement` - Decrement button\n  - `adults-count` - Display count\n  - `adults-increment` - Increment button\n- `passenger-row-children` - Children row\n  - `children-decrement` - Decrement button\n  - `children-count` - Display count\n  - `children-increment` - Increment button\n- `passenger-row-infants` - Infants row\n  - `infants-decrement` - Decrement button\n  - `infants-count` - Display count\n  - `infants-increment` - Increment button\n\n### 6. CabinClassSelector Component Test IDs\n**File:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/CabinClassSelector.tsx`\n\n- `cabin-class-selector` - Main container\n- `cabin-class-trigger` - Trigger button\n- `cabin-class-dropdown` - Dropdown container\n- `cabin-class-option-{VALUE}` - Individual cabin class options:\n  - `cabin-class-option-economy` - Economy option\n  - `cabin-class-option-premium_economy` - Premium Economy option\n  - `cabin-class-option-business` - Business option\n  - `cabin-class-option-first` - First class option\n\n### 7. Apply/Done Buttons in SearchSummaryBar\n- `summary-passengers-done` - Done button in passenger editor\n- `summary-cabin-done` - Done button in cabin class editor\n\n### How Inline Editing Works\n\n1. **Origin/Destination Editing:**\n   - Click the origin/destination chip to open the AirportAutocomplete editor\n   - Type to search for airports (by name, city, or IATA code)\n   - Suggestions appear in a dropdown\n   - Click a suggestion to select it\n   - Editor closes automatically and URL updates\n\n2. **Date Editing:**\n   - Click the dates chip to open the DatePicker for departure date\n   - Calendar opens showing available dates\n   - Navigate months with prev/next buttons\n   - Click a date to select it\n   - For round trip, return date editor appears separately\n   - Editor closes and URL updates\n\n3. **Passenger Editin